{"id":"a6a902146de6a471","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-nss-def.md","title":"Nies–Shore–Slaman 的 c.e. jump 类可定义性","display":"thm-nss-def — Nies–Shore–Slaman 的 c.e. jump 类可定义性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-nss-def","aliases":["20-thm-nss-def"],"display":"thm-nss-def — Nies–Shore–Slaman 的 c.e. jump 类可定义性","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.degree-structure","source_kind":"external-primary","verification_status":"source-statement-proof-pending","source_reference":"[Nies–Shore–Slaman, Interpretability and Definability in the Recursively Enumerable Degrees (1998), DOI 10.1112/S002461159800046X](https://londmathsoc.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1112/S002461159800046X)","depends_on":["[[20-df-redeg]]","[[20-df-low-high]]","[[20-df-formula]]","[[20-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-nss-def"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-nss-def</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-nss-def — Nies–Shore–Slaman 的 c.e. jump 类可定义性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.degree-structure"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"external-primary"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-proof-pending"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"<a href=\"https://londmathsoc.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1112/S002461159800046X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Nies–Shore–Slaman, Interpretability and Definability in the Recursively Enumerable Degrees (1998), DOI 10.1112/S002461159800046X</a>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d4a7833057f5a20e\" href=\"?note=d4a7833057f5a20e\" title=\"20-df-satisfaction\">20-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot\\le\">\\(\\dot\\le\\)</span> 是原语言中的唯一二元关系标签；它与变量及逻辑标签不交。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span> 为 c.e. 度载体，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le\">\\(\\le\\)</span> 为其继承的度顺序；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_n,H_n\">\\(L_n,H_n\\)</span> 沿用原低度和高度族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Form}_1\">\\(\\operatorname{Form}_1\\)</span> 的下标 1 表示唯一自由变量为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak R\\models\\theta[\\mathbf a]\">\\(\\mathfrak R\\models\\theta[\\mathbf a]\\)</span> 保留为单元素元组赋值的记法。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d4a7833057f5a20e\" href=\"?note=d4a7833057f5a20e\" title=\"20-df-satisfaction\">20-df-satisfaction</a>。</p>\n<aside class=\"callout\" data-kind=\"todo\"><div class=\"callout-title\">核验边界</div><p>保留原 source-statement-proof-pending 状态；本次补齐陈述的语法和语义接口，不把其升级为已独立证明的定理。</p>\n</aside>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathcal L_\\le:=(\\varnothing,\\{\\dot\\le\\},\\varnothing,\\{(\\dot\\le,2)\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Form}_1(\\mathcal L_\\le):=\\{\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L_\\le):\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)=\\{v_0\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak R:=(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}},\\varnothing,\n\\{(\\dot\\le,\\{(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b)\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}^2:\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf b\\})\\}),\\\\\n\\mathfrak R\\models\\theta[\\mathbf a]\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathfrak R\\models\\theta[(\\mathbf a)]\n\\quad(\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Form}_1(\\mathcal L_\\le),\\ \\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathcal L_\\le:=(\\varnothing,\\{\\dot\\le\\},\\varnothing,\\{(\\dot\\le,2)\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Form}_1(\\mathcal L_\\le):=\\{\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L_\\le):\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)=\\{v_0\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathfrak R:=(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}},\\varnothing,\n\\{(\\dot\\le,\\{(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b)\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}^2:\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf b\\})\\}),\\\\\n\\mathfrak R\\models\\theta[\\mathbf a]\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\mathfrak R\\models\\theta[(\\mathbf a)]\n\\quad(\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Form}_1(\\mathcal L_\\le),\\ \\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nss\\text{-}def}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\left[n\\ge2\\Rightarrow\n\\exists\\lambda_n,\\eta_{n-1}\\in\\operatorname{Form}_1(\\mathcal L_\\le)\\\n\\forall\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n\\bigl((\\mathfrak R\\models\\lambda_n[\\mathbf a]\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbf a\\in L_n)\n\\land(\\mathfrak R\\models\\eta_{n-1}[\\mathbf a]\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbf a\\in H_{n-1})\\bigr)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}nss\\text{-}def}\\vdash\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\left[n\\ge2\\Rightarrow\n\\exists\\lambda_n,\\eta_{n-1}\\in\\operatorname{Form}_1(\\mathcal L_\\le)\\\n\\forall\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n\\bigl((\\mathfrak R\\models\\lambda_n[\\mathbf a]\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbf a\\in L_n)\n\\land(\\mathfrak R\\models\\eta_{n-1}[\\mathbf a]\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbf a\\in H_{n-1})\\bigr)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>仅用一个二元关系符号的语言及其解释现在与上游 Form 和满足关系的结构格式一致。Form₁ 不再只是自然语言说明，单参数满足也明确展开为原有限元组满足接口。原量词次序、层级下标和待核验定理的数学结论保持不变。</p>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://londmathsoc.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1112/S002461159800046X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Nies–Shore–Slaman, Interpretability and Definability in the Recursively Enumerable Degrees (1998), DOI 10.1112/S002461159800046X</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-redeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-low-high","status":"resolved","id":"91065cedbdf2fc27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-low-high]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"d4a7833057f5a20e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAncho